<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Project Sdk="Dalamud.NET.Sdk/15.0.0">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>0.4.0.0</Version>
    <!-- Manifest fields — see https://github.com/goatcorp/DalamudPackager -->
    <Author>Pop115</Author>
    <Name>Arsenal Cleanup</Name>
    <Punchline>Sorts your Armoury Chest into what is worth keeping and what is not.</Punchline>
    <Description>Reads your Armoury Chest and the gear you are wearing, compares each piece
against everything else you own for the same slot, and tells you what you can stop carrying around.

It takes your job levels into account, so it never suggests parting with the only weapon you can
actually hold, and it says how to part with what it flags: the Armoire first (kept forever, nothing
lost), then desynthesis (materials back), then discarding. Relics are never suggested for disposal.

Everything happens in game, from the game's own item data — no companion app, and nothing to keep in
step with patches. A JSON export is there for anyone wiring it into a tool of their own.</Description>
    <RepoUrl>https://github.com/Pop115/ClaudeGithubWorkspace</RepoUrl>
    <Tags>inventory;armoury;cleanup;gear;export</Tags>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
